@baseUrl = http://localhost:5275

### Students - list (5 capabilities)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?search=nguyen&sort=fullName,-dateOfBirth&page=1&size=10&fields=studentId,fullName,email&expand=enrollments

### Students - by id + fields + expand
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1?fields=studentId,fullName&expand=enrollments

### Semesters - list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/semesters?search=2024&sort=-startDate&page=1&size=5&expand=courses

### Courses - list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses?search=PRN&sort=courseName&page=1&size=10&expand=semester,enrollments

### Courses - enrollments nested
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1/enrollments?expand=student&sort=-enrollDate&page=1&size=20&fields=enrollmentId,status

### Subjects - list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects?search=PRN&sort=subjectCode&page=1&size=10&fields=subjectId,subjectCode,credit

### Enrollments - list (lab example)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollments?search=active&sort=-enrollDate&page=1&size=20&fields=enrollmentId,status&expand=student,course

### Enrollments - by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollments/1?fields=enrollmentId,status&expand=student,course
